ised a mes-senger, among the people who had no Scripture, to recite His revelations to them, to make them grow spiritually and teach them the Scripture and wisdom––before that they were clearly astray––","22":"It is He Who has sent amongst the Unlettered a messenger from among themselves, to rehearse to them His Signs, to sanctify them, and to instruct them in Scripture and Wisdom,- although they had been, before, in manifest error;-","203":"He it is Who sent among the unlettered ones a Messenger (Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم) from among themselves, reciting to them His Verses, purifying them (from the filth of disbelief and polytheism), and teaching them the Book (this Qur’ân, Islâmic laws and Islâmic jurisprudence) and Al-Hikmah (As-Sunnah: legal ways, orders, acts of worship of Prophet Muhammad صلى الله عليه وسلم). And verily, they had been before in manifest error;"},"words":[{"id":1330,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"هُوَ","translation":{"text":"He","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"huwa","language_name":"english"}},{"id":1331,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","translation":{"text":"(is) the One Who","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"alladhī","language_name":"english"}},{"id":1332,"position":3,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"بَعَثَ","translation":{"text":"sent","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"baʿatha","language_name":"english"}},{"id":1333,"position":4,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فِى","translation":{"text":"among","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"fī","language_name":"english"}},{"id":1334,"position":5,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُمِّيِّـۧنَ","translation":{"text":"the unlettered","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-umiyīna","language_name":"english"}},{"id":1335,"position":6,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"رَسُولًۭا","translation":{"text":"a Messenger","language_name":"