favour is immense.","22":"Such is the Bounty of Allah, which He bestows on whom He will: and Allah is the Lord of the highest bounty.","203":"That is the Grace of Allâh, which He bestows on whom He wills. And Allâh is the Owner of Mighty Grace."},"words":[{"id":3805,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","translation":{"text":"That","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"dhālika","language_name":"english"}},{"id":3806,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"فَضْلُ","translation":{"text":"(is the) Bounty","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"faḍlu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":3807,"position":3,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","translation":{"text":"(of) Allah","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-lahi","language_name":"english"}},{"id":3808,"position":4,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يُؤْتِيهِ","translation":{"text":"He gives it","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"yu'tīhi","language_name":"english"}},{"id":3809,"position":5,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَن","translation":{"text":"(to) whom","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"man","language_name":"english"}},{"id":3810,"position":6,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","translation":{"text":"He wills","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"yashāu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":3812,"position":7,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","translation":{"text":"And Allah","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"wal-lahu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":3813,"position":8,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ذُو","translation":{"text":"(is the) Possessor","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"dhū","language_name":"english"}},{"id":3814,"position":9,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَضْلِ","translation":{"text":"(of) Bounty","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-faḍli","language_name":"english"}},{"id":3815,"position":10,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَظِيمِ","translation":{"text":"the Great","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-ʿaẓīmi","language_name":"english"}}]},{"id":5182,"verse_number":5,"verse_key":"62:5","juz_number":28,"rub_el_hizb_number":221,"hizb_number":56,"ruku_number":488,"manzil_number":7,"sajdah_number":null,"page_number":553,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلُ ٱلَّذِينَ حُمِّلُوا۟ ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَحْمِلُوهَا كَمَثَلِ ٱلْحِمَارِ يَحْمِلُ أَسْفَارًۢا ۚ بِئْسَ مَثَلُ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","trs":{"20":"The example of those who were entrusted with the Torah and then did not take it on<sup foot_note=197556>1</sup> is like that of a donkey who carries volumes [of books].<sup foot_note=197555>2</sup> Wretched is the example of the people who deny the signs of Allāh. And Allāh does not guide the wrongdoing people.","85":"Those who have been charged to obey the Torah, but do not do so, are like asses carrying books: how base such people are who disobey God’s revelations! God does not guide people who do wrong.","22":"The similitude of those who were charged with the (obligations of the) Mosaic Law, but who subsequently failed in those (obligations), is that of a donkey which carries huge tomes (but understands them not). Evil is the similitude of people who falsify the Signs of Allah: and Allah guides not people who do wrong.","203":"The likeness of those who were entrusted with the (obligation of the) Taurât (Torah) (i.e. to obey its commandments and to practise its laws), but who subsequently failed in those (obligations), is as the likeness of a donkey which carries huge burdens of books (but understands nothing from them). How bad is the example of people who deny the Ayât (proofs, evidence, verses, signs, revelations) of Allâh. And Allâh guides not the people who are Zâlimûn(polytheists, wrong-doers, disbelievers)."},"words":[{"id":5066,"position":1,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"مَثَلُ","translation":{"text":"(The) likeness","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"mathalu","language_name":"english"}},{"id":5067,"position":2,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","translation":{"text":"(of) those who","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"alladhīna","language_name":"english"}},{"id":5068,"position":3,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"حُمِّلُوا۟","translation":{"text":"were entrusted","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"ḥummilū","language_name":"english"}},{"id":5069,"position":4,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ","translation":{"text":"(with) the Taurat","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-tawrāta","language_name":"english"}},{"id":5070,"position":5,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","translation":{"text":"then","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"thumma","language_name":"english"}},{"id":5071,"position":6,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"لَمْ","translation":{"text":"not","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"lam","language_name":"english"}},{"id":5072,"position":7,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَحْمِلُوهَا","translation":{"text":"they bore it","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"yaḥmilūhā","language_name":"english"}},{"id":5073,"position":8,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"كَمَثَلِ","translation":{"text":"(is) like","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"kamathali","language_name":"english"}},{"id":5074,"position":9,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"ٱلْحِمَارِ","translation":{"text":"the donkey","language_name":"english"},"transliteration":{"text":"l-ḥimāri","language_name":"english"}},{"id":5075,"position":10,"char_type_name":"word","text_uthmani":"يَحْمِلُ","translation":{"text":"who carries","language_name":"english"},"transliteration"